     [38;5;246mExplicit service layer emits Event rows; worker creates per-user Notification rows. Cheap read/unread and email [39m
     [38;5;246mdedup, free activity feed, clean path to more channels. One extra moving part.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Event log, fan-out on read
